DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: T ROWE PRICE OHA SELECT PRIVATE CREDIT FUND (OCREDIT)\nRoadshow: w
 ww.netroadshow.com/nrs/home/#!/?show=8341b1b7 (Recommended) | Entry Code: 
 OCREDIT2026 | URL: www.netroadshow.com\n\nDeal context:\nT. Rowe Price OHA
  Select Private Credit Fund ("OCREDIT")\, rated Baa3 (stable) by Moody's a
 nd BBB- (stable) by Fitch\, has mandated J.P. Morgan\, BNP PARIBAS\, SMBC 
 Nikko\, and Wells Fargo Securities to arrange a series of fixed income inv
 estor calls on June 24\, 2026\, ahead of a potential capital markets trans
 action. The deal is at the Mandate stage\, with no specific size\, tenor\,
  coupon\, or pricing terms disclosed at this time. A capital markets trans
 action may follow subject to market conditions\, with investor calls sched
 uled throughout the day on June 24th.
